  #line-at(69.6pt, 242.16pt, "neutron and gamma peaks determined by fitting two Gaussian functions, respectively, quantifies the PSD ")
  #line-at(69.6pt, 261.12pt, "performance of a scintillator sample at the given energy deposition.  ")
  #line-at(81.6pt, 286.08pt, "As average pulse shapes are expected to vary with the scintillator material (which is the reason for ")
  #line-at(69.6pt, 305.04pt, "varying PSD performance), the short integration gate was separately optimized for each of the materials ")
  #line-at(69.6pt, 324pt, "investigated. For this purpose, the gate width was varied between 30 and 60 ns in steps of 5 pulse samples ")
  #line-at(69.6pt, 342.96pt, "(2 ns), and the gate length providing the maximum FOM for energy depositions between 452 and 502 ")
  #line-at(69.6pt, 362.16pt, "keVee (i.e., an energy slice around the 477 keV Compton edge of ")
  #set text(font: "Times New Roman", size: 6.96pt, weight: "regular", style: "normal", fill: rgb("#000000"))
